Remove the producer-specific schema/conversion fixture actual_checkqueue_constructor_keeps_additional_worker_count. Its checks only restated migrated field names, values and text; lasting generic renderer, copied-value, formatting, filtering, queue and shutdown behavior tests remain. No production change; source-only cleanup.
